msgstr "Stappen"

#: src/Modules/Pdp/Frontend/PdpPreparationView.php
msgid ""
"Give yourself a score from 1 to 5 for each item. Your trainer sees your "
"scores once you mark your preparation as ready. You can change everything "
"until the conversation starts."
msgstr ""
"Geef jezelf per onderdeel een cijfer van 1 tot 5. Je trainer ziet jouw "
"cijfers zodra je je voorbereiding klaar meldt. Je kunt alles aanpassen tot "
"het gesprek begint."

#. translators: %s: the item being scored
#: src/Modules/Pdp/Frontend/PdpPreparationView.php
msgid "My score for %s"
msgstr "Mijn cijfer voor %s"

#: src/Modules/Pdp/Frontend/PdpPreparationView.php
msgid "Not filled in yet"
msgstr "Nog niet ingevuld"

#. translators: 1: the score, 2: its label in the form's scale
#: src/Modules/Pdp/Frontend/PdpPreparationView.php
msgid "Your score: %1$s · %2$s"
msgstr "Jouw cijfer: %1$s · %2$s"

#: src/Modules/Pdp/Frontend/PdpPreparationView.php
msgctxt "PDP preparation: mark it finished"
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Klaar"

#: src/Modules/Pdp/Frontend/PdpPreparationView.php
